/E (Maternal mortality includes deaths of women during pregnancy, delivery, and within 42 days of delivery. The maternal mortality ratio \(MMR\) for Ethiopia is 141 maternal deaths per 100,000 live births for the seven-year period before the survey. The confidence interval for the MMR ranges from 87 to 195 deaths per 100,000 live births.)
