/Title (The use of modern family planning methods is higher among currently married women in urban areas \(44%\) than among women in rural areas \(30%\). Modern method use ranges from 2% of currently married women in Somali to 56% in Sidama. Modern method use generally increases as level of education and household wealth increase.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 6540 0 R
/Prev 6551 0 R
>>
