<<
/Title (About four in ten women using modern methods were informed about side effects \(40%\) and what to do if they experience side effects \(41%\), and 47% were informed about other family planning methods that were available. Overall, 33% of women using modern methods received all three types of information. While 60% of women who use the IUD received all three types of information, only 27% of women who used injectables received all three types of information.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 6541 0 R
/Prev 6567 0 R
>>
