6591 0 obj
<<
/Title (Eleven percent of children under age 5 had diarrhoea in the two weeks before the survey. Among them, advice or treatment was sought for 43%. Children with diarrhoea should drink more fluids, particularly through oral rehydration therapy \(ORT\). One-third \(33%\) of children with diarrhoea received ORT, while 40% of children with diarrhoea received no treatment.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 6572 0 R
